 "page_text": " Adhan Recordings | The Wahy Project Skip to primary content The Wahy Project Re-discovering Islam Search Main menu Home Index Allah Quran Hajj Supplication Help Contact Bibliography License About Post navigation ← Previous Next → Adhan Recordings Posted on September 5, 2011 by thewahyproject My Adhan Recordings from Masjid Al-Haram (Makkah) and Masjid Al-Nabawi (Madinah) The air is still, the crowd calm, the anticipation palatable. As we sit, enjoy and savor our time in Masjid Al-Haram, our ears suddenly fill with the sweet sounds of Adhan (call to prayer) – echoing & reverberating throughout Makkah. It is such an amazing feeling and experience that words cannot do it justice – SubhaanAllaah. But as a special treat … I finally had a chance to upload some of my Adhan (& Iqama ) recordings from Makkah and Madinah to share with you. Actually a while back I tried searching for Adhan audio files online and found it quite difficult. Alhamdulillah I was able to record these (with a small voice recorder) last year (2010 / 1431) in Makkah and Madinah in the month of Dhul Hijjah . Enjoy … Masjid Al-Haram (Makkah) Salah Adhan Iqama Extra Fajr http://dl.dropbox.com/u/39656064/Adhan-Makkah/Adhan_MakkahMasjidAlHaram_Fajr_20101110_0538.mp3 mp3 http://dl.dropbox.com/u/39656064/Adhan-Makkah/Iqama_MakkahMasjidAlHaram_Fajr_20101110_0538.mp3 mp3 mp3 Zuhr http://dl.dropbox.com/u/39656064/Adhan-Makkah/Adhan_MakkahMasjidAlHaram_Zuhr_20101109_1207.mp3 mp3 http://dl.dropbox.com/u/39656064/Adhan-Makkah/Iqama_MakkahMasjidAlHaram_Zuhr_20101110_1225.mp3 mp3 mp3 Asr http://dl.dropbox.com/u/39656064/Adhan-Makkah/Adhan_MakkahMasjidAlHaram_Asr_20101109_1535.mp3 mp3 http://dl.dropbox.com/u/39656064/Adhan-Makkah/Iqama_MakkahMasjidAlHaram_Asr_20101109_1535.mp3 mp3 mp3 Maghrib http://dl.dropbox.com/u/39656064/Adhan-Makkah/Adhan_MakkahMasjidAlHaram_Maghrib_20101109_1803.mp3 mp3 http://dl.dropbox.com/u/39656064/Adhan-Makkah/Iqama_MakkahMasjidAlHaram_Maghrib_20101109_1803.mp3 mp3 Isha http